OL,3,AHome secretary scraps plan for migrant
OL,4,Acare workers already in UK to wait 15
OL,5,Ayears for settlement
OL,6,
OL,7,FShabana Mahmood scraps plans for
OL,8,Fmigrant care workers already in the UK
OL,9,Fto wait 15 years for permanent
OL,10,Fsettlement - here's what else we learnt
OL,12,FAs long as care workers earn at least
OL,13,F#25,000 a year and arrived in the UK
OL,14,Fbefore May 2025, they will be eligible
OL,15,Ffor indefinite leave to remain (ILR)
OL,16,Fafter five years
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
PN,30202
SC,0002
