OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1793645760
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AHome secretary scraps plan for migrant
OL,4,Acare workers already in UK to wait 15
OL,5,Ayears for settlement
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe changes announced by Mahmood today,
OL,8,Fafter some opposition from MPs in her
OL,9,Fown party to her original proposals,
OL,10,Fhave spared some 282,000 people from
OL,11,Fdelayed settlement, down from around
OL,12,F799,000 people to 517,000
OL,14,FThe home secretary told MPs the policy
OL,15,Fwas "guided above all by fairness" and
OL,16,Fthose not covered by the new exceptions
OL,17,Fwill be on a 10-year path to settlement
OL,18,Fstatus, including people earning less
OL,19,Fthan #50,000
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
PN,30203
SC,0003
